{"id":"235651614fd28cce","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-pi1-incompleteness.md","title":"Pi 1 Incompleteness","display":"thm-pi1-incompleteness — Pi_1 Incompleteness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-pi1-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-pi1-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-pi1-incompleteness — Pi_1 Incompleteness","depends_on":["[[92-df-pi1-formula]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-standard-model]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","[[92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 VIII–IX 章 pp. 102–110（PDF 119–127）；复杂度保持构造为本地补充","source_status":"本地复杂度推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-pi1-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-pi1-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pi1-incompleteness — Pi_1 Incompleteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140342deea557884\" href=\"?note=140342deea557884\" title=\"92-df-pi1-formula\">92-df-pi1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b0cf42030c298d08\" href=\"?note=b0cf42030c298d08\" title=\"92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1\">92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII–IX 章 pp. 102–110（PDF 119–127）；复杂度保持构造为本地补充"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地复杂度推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Pi_1^G\\)</span> (first universal arithmetical level)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> (standard arithmetic structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (effectivity and arithmetic-strength conditions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> (selected Sigma-1 provability formula)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pi1\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Pi_1^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\varphi\\land G\\nvdash\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pi1\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Pi_1^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\varphi\\land G\\nvdash\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>不完备性：存在真<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>句子不可证</li>\n<li>Gödel句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_G \\in \\Pi_1\">\\(\\varphi_G \\in \\Pi_1\\)</span>是真但不可证的</li>\n<li>对标准证明公式，内部一致性句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>也是一个可用的真而不可证的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>例子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>完备 + <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>不完备</li>\n<li>这是不完备性的层级视角</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>真且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>只说明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>是假的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>句；要由此推出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi\">\\(G\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>还需<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>一致性或<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>可靠性，普通一致性不足</li>\n</ul>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>选定的可证性公式为 Σ1，固定点图采用复杂度保持的规范构造，才可选取 Π1 见证。对当前 PA 也可使用内部一致性句：它标准真值正确，且由 HBL 第二不完备性不可证。任意可证等价句子不继承字面层级；普通相容性不排除假 Σ1 句被证明。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII–IX 章 pp. 102–110（PDF 119–127）；复杂度保持构造为本地补充。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-pi1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"140342deea557884","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-pi1-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnch